                "text": "The recent downgrading of the American currency affects all of us. It affects our economy, debt, and the future of our children. As I have stated many times before, we are out of time to do the right thing. Putting off Medicaid reform for 4 years is irresponsible and unnecessary. Putting off essential cuts to bloated government spending is a dereliction of duty. It is a time for choosing\u2026",
